### Playgo smoke test — VS Code REST Client format
### Run sequentially. After each request, copy values into the variables below.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@email = smoke_{{$timestamp}}@example.com
@username = smoke_{{$timestamp}}
@password = Password123!
@accessToken = paste-after-login
@refreshToken = paste-after-login
@contentId = paste-from-list
@reviewId = paste-after-review-create
@planId = paste-after-plans-list
@paymentId = paste-after-subscribe

### 1. Register a new user (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Login (expect 200 + tokens)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailOrUsername": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Get current user (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Featured contents (expect 200, populated in dev/staging)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents/featured?limit=10

### 5. Paged list (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents?page=1&pageSize=10

### 6. Movies legacy alias (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/movies?page=1&limit=10

### 7. Add to favorites (expect 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/favorites/{{contentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. List favorites (expect 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Add to watchlist (expect 204)
POST {{baseUrl}}/watchlist/{{contentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 10. Create review (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contentId": "{{contentId}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Smoke-test review"
}

### 11. Vote on review (expect 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}/vote
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "voteType": 1
}

### 12. Get plans (expect 200, 3 default plans)
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans

### 13. Subscribe via Manual provider (expect 200, returns paymentId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "planId": "{{planId}}",
  "provider": "Manual"
}

### 14. Manual provider callback — completes the payment (expect 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/callback/Manual
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "{{paymentId}}",
  "transactionId": "smoke-test-tx-1"
}

### 15. My subscription (expect 200, status active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Health probes (expect 200 / 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/../health/live

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/../health/ready
